WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.567
In the second half of the nineteenth century, the Qing dynasty faced a serious crisis.

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:07.408
Some officials decided to learn Western technology.

00:00:07.408 --> 00:00:10.348
The steamship model on the table was made with great detail.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:14.510
Zeng Guofan and Li Hongzhang promoted the Self-Strengthening Movement.

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:17.908
They set up factories and manufactured new-style machinery.

00:00:17.908 --> 00:00:21.665
The roar of the machines spread throughout the entire factory.

00:00:21.665 --> 00:00:25.797
In the shipyard, craftsmen built steamships.

00:00:25.797 --> 00:00:29.113
On the day the great ship was launched, people cheered and applauded.

00:00:29.113 --> 00:00:32.402
In the new-style schools, students learned new knowledge.

00:00:32.402 --> 00:00:35.788
Young people studied mechanics, mathematics, and foreign languages.

00:00:35.788 --> 00:00:39.380
The teachers taught earnestly, and the students listened attentively.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:42.558
A group of students traveled by ship to study abroad for further education.

00:00:42.558 --> 00:00:45.680
Telegraph lines and railways also gradually appeared.

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:49.887
Family members at the dock waved to see them off.

00:00:49.887 --> 00:00:53.922
They hoped the country would thereby become strong.

00:00:53.922 --> 00:00:56.635
Although there were many limitations, change had already begun.
